{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"First two beings of power contact me at once, then I get possessed, then I come here, and now I have a baby playing with my tail.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:10:37.968000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878083573675085884","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Nolan plays with the baby and Secel. “I was… sus-pect of Mal, too… he is a good guy. Does much good for the cit-y here.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:16:51.488000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878085140331524167","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"I want to know just what Malathor did to piss an Archdevil so much she wanted him dead.\" She looks at Nolan. \"I never felt such a single minded ferocity before.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:19:49.921000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878085888733761546","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“You seemed… out of your-self. An ef-fect of the devil?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:20:34.403000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878086075304775721","reply_to_id":"878085888733761546","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"Did I sound like me while it was happening?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:21:39.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878086346487517224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"He shakes his head. “I have not known you to have…. That wrath and hate-red….”","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:22:20.774000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878086521457106974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"What about physically? I still remember when they used me as a vessel to speak through. Was it my voice, or different?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:28:01.439000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878087950309687296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“It was… not. And your eyes were… red. And you were smo-king.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:38:11.057000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878090507232870401","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"Then I guess it was a full possession.\" She pauses for a moment. \"I also feel... different.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:41:51.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878091432244703232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“Your horns… changed.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:55:30.036000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878094865026658415","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“Looks… bad-ass.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T01:55:40.418000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878094908571934720","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"She slowly reaches up and touches them. “Huh. Sharper then normal.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:00:21.703000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878096088366743583","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"He nods. “Al-so… why do you… hate Mal so much?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:10:29.554000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878098637878607943","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“I did not trust him at the beg-in-ning I will ad-mit… but his work here…”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:11:32.838000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878098903310934067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"She bites her lip. “It’s… complicated.” She sits down. “Tieflings inherently are distrusted. That distrust goes both ways. Because he’s a Tiefling as well, it just makes that sort of thing… stronger i guess is the best way to put it.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:16:59.065000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878100271606141000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“Mm… Man-y people… they hate and mistrust me… for how I look. And you… as well, for the same rea-sons as Mal. We must stick to-gether, yes?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:22:25.062000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878101638936670238","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“That’s why we find people we care about…” She goes quiet.","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:29:04.076000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878103312522694738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“This is why we show all people care.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:36:43.546000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878105239679533068","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"She nods, but her mouth quivers a little.","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:39:05.578000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878105835404939265","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"He offers her a 5 armed hug","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:39:37.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878105967521325117","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"She accepts the hug and sighs. “I miss him…”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:47:34.482000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878107969903022091","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“He was… a good man. I do not know what… became… of him… but he loved you. This I know.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:52:41.578000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878109257957007430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“I probably scared him off… maybe this would have done that if I hadn’t already….”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:53:25.155000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878109440732188702","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"He shakes his head. “No. This is not the case. I knew him. A lamp-light-er. And he was not scared… of you.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T02:58:59.359000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T02:59:05.653000Z","id":"878110842485354536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“But… he never saw me like that…” She backs away a little. “I willingly let them both use me as a vessel to try and get you guys to listen. I knew if I tried it alone you guys would just think it’s me not liking Malathor.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T03:16:07.304000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878115153999171655","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“It… was not ab-out that. We would listen… but we had still ag-reed to aid Mal. I do not think… he de-served what-ever that spider could… do.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T03:18:21.452000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878115716656693309","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“They both asked in unison ‘Why should we prevent the imprisonment of Malathor?’. How do I explain that?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T03:22:19.605000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T03:24:34.310000Z","id":"878116715542749185","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“From what I… know of gods… they have their own… a-gen-das. There is nothing they… could gain from sa-ving him. And he *does* have pow-er. This is… a bit scar-y, to have such a strength.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T03:42:58.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878121913933787157","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"She thinks for a moment. “I don’t think that demon was meant to kill him. Yes, it’s a demon, and my limited understanding of them as is has them as beings of pure carnage. But… well, think about it. It really only went after him. And they referred to it as an imprisonment….” Another pause. There’s something in her eyes that shows she won’t drop that point.","created_at":"2021-08-20T03:47:50.513000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878123136636305440","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“I will… help you find out more, if you wish? I am sure… we can find the de-tails our-selves?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T03:51:00.899000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878123935173074944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"“I would appreciate it.” She pauses again. “What kept you all from killing me?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T03:52:26.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878124296197775401","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"He looks at her like she’s crazy. “Why on… earth… would we kill you?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T03:54:33.305000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878124826068414514","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"She stares at him. “For all you knew I could have no longer been there.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T03:56:10.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878125231808593931","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
